  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sorry to be nitpicky; this Canny post might be irrelevant by the time that it gets looked into, but the Launch Pad banners haven't been updated or utilized as often.\nThere's still a banner promoting the release of the Identity Update, and Dev Stream Recap, which were over one year ago. There's no need for it to be there anymore\nThe most recent banner available is for IK 2.0; four months ago.\nI suggest having an MOTD available on the banner; have a banner promotion regarding the intense beta testing underway. Maybe banners for relevant community get-togethers, such as sponsored events like VKet and Furality; banners for World and Avatar community Jams.\n\nThe banners also seem to scroll too fast, not really giving the user a chance to look at the most up-to-date banner before switching over to older ones.",
